        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Oakland faces a busted budget, years of displacement attenuating the community, and a downtown struggling to build and maintain critical mass.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Barbara Lee has won huge electoral victories in the East Bay over multiple terms.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The next few years will require serious leadership in Oakland.",
