        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Creative communities and institutional density indicate resilience potential despite structural issues.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "Public trust in elected officials depends heavily on demonstrated performance over time.",
        "confidence": 0.84
      },
      {
        "text": "Media coverage of elections should highlight key differences between leading candidates.",
        "confidence": 0.83
      },
      {
        "text": "The recall of Mayor Sheng Tao signals widespread dissatisfaction with current governance.",
