    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92652.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "You know, many people, longtime Oakland folks, when they heard that you were entering the race, the other name that came up was your longtime mentor, also a Congress person who held your same seat, longtime mentor, then came in as Oakland mayor as well. I think it's fair to say he had a rocky time as Oakland Mayor. Did that give you pause that this person who had held your seat before you and then come into Oakland Mayor had the time to make you think twice about doing it?",
