    "turn_text": "Also, just listening into that question, though, I do want to get what I think is kind of behind it, which is that, obviously, former Mayor Chiangtao, who was recalled, also indicted, both you and Lauren Taylor have been not wanting to be tied to her and wanting the other person to be tied to her. I mean, if you've seen it in mailers from both of you. You know, 60% of voters approve the recall. You did not support it. Obviously, she was indicted after the recall. Talk to me about like, what were your thoughts about the recall and why you didn't support it?",
